course: dictionary
lesson: 8665
title: Secondary: second, or less important
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Secondary often means second in order or importance. Look at the words around it: «SATs do not decide whether you go to secondary school: everyone moves up.» Secondary school is the school you go to after primary school. The clue is that everyone moves up, so it must be the next step.
explain: Secondary can also mean less important. «Of secondary importance» means a thing matters, but not as much as the main thing. Check it by swapping in your meaning: if the main thing matters most, the second thing matters less.
explain: Secondary can also mean something that comes after or is caused by something else. In art, «the secondary colours green, orange and purple» are made by mixing two primary colours. The word tells you these colours come second, from the first ones.
fact: Secondary means second in importance, or less important.
fact: Secondary school is the school children go to after primary school, usually from about age 11 to 18.
fact: Painters' primary colours are red, yellow and blue. Secondary colours are made by mixing two of them: green, orange and purple.
fact: In history, a secondary source is written later about an event.
fact: «Secondary» is an adjective. In UK informal speech, «a secondary» can also mean a secondary school.
exercise: «SATs do not decide whether you go to secondary school.» What is a secondary school? | A shop that sells paint | The first school ever built | A place for babies | *The school children go to after primary school
exercise: «The secondary colours green, orange and purple» are made how? | From sunlight alone | *By mixing two primary colours | Only from black and white | From water and sand
exercise: «Of secondary importance» means what? | Painted in orange | Very loud | The most important thing | *Less important than the main thing
test: What does secondary mean in «a secondary source»? | Written in secret code | The biggest book in the library | *Written later about an event | Written before anything happened
test: Mixing red and yellow makes which secondary colour? | Blue | Black | *Orange | White
exam: Which word best fits? The bread was the main meal, and the soup was ___. | *Secondary | Primary | Ancient | Glum
